  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abrahaam Qorame",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroo muraasa booddee Waaqni Abrahaamin qore. Innis, \"Abrahaam!\" jedhee isa waame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 22:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abrahaamis, \"Kunoo asan jira\" jedhee deebise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqnis akkana jedheen; \"Ilma kee Yisihaaq, ilma kee tokkicha isa jaallattu sana fudhiitii biyya Mooriyaa dhaqi. Tulluu ani sitti himu irratti qalma gubamu godhiitii isa dhiʼeessi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahaamis guyyaa itti aanu ganama barraaqaan kaʼee harree isaa feʼate. Innis hojjettoota isaa keessaa nama lamaa fi ilma isaa Yisihaaqin fudhatee qoraan qalma gubamuuf gaʼu cabsatee gara iddoo Waaqni isatti hime sanaatti qajeele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyyaa sadaffaattis Abrahaam ol ilaalee iddoo sana fagootti arge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis hojjettoota isaatiin, \"Isin harree wajjin asuma turaa. Anii fi mucichi duuba sana dhaqnaa; achittis waaqeffannee gara keessanitti deebinaa\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahaamis qoraan aarsaa gubamuuf taʼu fuudhee ilma isaa Yisihaaqin baachise; ofii isaatii immoo ibiddaa fi billaa harkatti qabate. Isaan lamaan utuu walumaan deemaa jiranuu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisihaaq, \"Yaa abbaa koo\" jedhee abbaa isaa Abrahaamitti dubbate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 22:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abrahaamis, \"Asan jira ilma koo\" jedhee deebise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 22:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yisihaaqis deebisee, \"Ibiddii fi qoraan kunoo ti; hoolaan qalma gubamuuf taʼu immoo eessa jira?\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahaamis deebisee, \"Yaa ilma ko, Waaqni mataan isaa hoolaa qalma gubamuuf taʼu ni kenna\" jedhe. Isaan lamaanis walumaan karaa isaanii itti fufan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroo iddoo Waaqni isatti hime sana gaʼanitti, Abrahaam iddoo aarsaa achitti ijaaree iddoo aarsaa sana irra qoraan naqe; ilma isaa Yisihaaqin hidhees iddoo aarsaa sana irra qoraan gubbaa ciibse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ergasii inni ilma isaa qaluuf jedhee harka isaa hiixatee billaa fudhate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ergamaan",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.22.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.22.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "garuu, \"Abrahaam! Abrahaam!\" jedhee samii keessaa isa waame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 22:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abrahaamis, \"Kunoo asan jira\" jedhee deebise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis, \"Ati harka keetiin gurbicha hin tuqin; waan tokko illee isa hin godhin. Waan ati ilma kee, ilmuma tokkicha anaaf jettee hin mararfatiniif, ani akka ati Waaqa sodaattu amma beekeera\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahaamis ol ilaalee kunoo korbeessa hoolaa kan gaanfi isaa daggala keessatti qabamee jiru tokko arge; innis dhaqee hoolaa sana fuudhee qooda ilma isaa qalma gubamu godhee dhiʼeesse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu Abrahaam iddoo sana \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.22.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.22.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni kenna\" jedhee moggaase; hamma harʼaatti illee, \"Tulluu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.22.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.22.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "irratti, ni kennama\" jedhama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ergamaan",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.22.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.22.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sunis samii keessaa lammata Abrahaamin waamee",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akkana jedheen; \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.22.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.22.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akkana jedha; sababii ati waan kana gootee fi ilma kee, ilmuma kee tokkicha illee na hin dhowwatiniif ani maqaa kootiin nan kakadha;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ani dhugumaan eebba, sin eebbisa; sanyii kees akkuma urjii samiitii fi akkuma cirracha qarqara galaanaa nan baayʼisa. Sanyiiwwan kees magaalaawwan diina isaanii ni dhuunfatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan ati naa ajajamteef sabni lafa irraa hundinuu karaa sanyii keetiin eebbifama.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ergasii Abrahaam tajaajiltoota isaatti deebiʼe; isaanis walumaan Bersheebaatti qajeelan; Abrahaamis Bersheebaa keessa jiraate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilmaan Naahoor",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroo muraasa booddee akkana jedhamee Abrahaamitti himame; \"Kunoo, Miilkaan obboleessa kee Naahooriif ilmaan deesseerti;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilmaan isheen deesses inni hangafni Uuzi, obboleessi isaa Buuz,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 22:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "abbaan Arraam immoo Qamuʼeel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keseedi, Hazoo, Fiildaas, Yiidlaafii fi Betuuʼeel jedhamu.\"",
